{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on your new role as big tech manager, feudal lord, or casino pit boss in Rogue Maze, a <strong>tile-based maze defense</strong> game that combines tower defense and deckbuilding elements with a darkly playful take on modern society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been brought in to manage the <strong>Rogues</strong>, an odd assortment of characters who just want to go home. These dastardly denizens try to cross each level along the shortest route. Redirect them through <i>labyrinths of your own design</i> and ensure they become too exhausted to leave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/6a0d21627a093e6fcac35e6a0ba4133b.poster.avif?t=1768603537\" aria-label=\"A sped-up build sequence from in-game. A translucent blue line is drawn to help with planning before tiles are placed on the board to create the labyrinth. After the first tiles are laid, waves of Rogues (NPCs) try to travel through. The board appears as a rectangular grassy island with lilac trees and castle walls at its edges.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/6a0d21627a093e6fcac35e6a0ba4133b.webm?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/6a0d21627a093e6fcac35e6a0ba4133b.mp4?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build with Intention</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a basic tile deck, you'll have the path segments needed to turn open floor plans into <i>optimally inefficient layouts</i>\u2014but you're not one to settle for the bare minimum, are you? Draw from a variety of <strong>Special Tiles</strong> to gain maze-work benefits like status effects and damage multipliers. With some strategic positioning, obstacles like stinky bathrooms, security lasers, or slip-and-slides (some assembly required) can dramatically boost that return on investment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/de0e19734b56eb1b748e8e501c94e2d2.poster.avif?t=1768603537\" aria-label=\"ALT TEXT: SNAKE LOOP A sped-up sequence of various Rogues traveling through a giant green snake wearing a monocle. Rogues can be seen entering the snake\u2019s mouth and traversing through its exposed rib cage. One small Rogue makes its escape from the tail end of the snake.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/de0e19734b56eb1b748e8e501c94e2d2.webm?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/de0e19734b56eb1b748e8e501c94e2d2.mp4?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exhaust and Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Troubled by a particularly pesky Rogue? <strong>Gadgets</strong> are conveniently located on each level to handle their insubordination. Deploy a giant springboard or offer free food to interrupt unwelcome activities and re-establish order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficiently address disruptive, rebellious behavior, and you'll be rewarded with a shiny new job title and increased visibility with Senior Leadership. Fail to meet your performance targets, however, and you'll be shown the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/1a9dacb5c564c3a5087c65dfbe87cb8a.poster.avif?t=1768603537\" aria-label=\"ALT TEXT: FIGHT LOOP A sped-up sequence of the Wrestling Tile in action. Several Rogues\u20142 neckless wrestlers and 2 anthropomorphic filing cabinets\u2014get into position in a square tile. The tile then rises from the floor as ropes and spotlights appear. A cartoonish cloud obscures a brief fight, after which the ring sinks back to floor level and one combatant walks away triumphant, with a wrestling belt held high.\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/1a9dacb5c564c3a5087c65dfbe87cb8a.webm?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/1a9dacb5c564c3a5087c65dfbe87cb8a.mp4?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze-as-a-Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Build labyrinths from tiles that act as both pathways and towers, amplifying the classic <i>mazing</i> thrill of tower defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hostile Architecture</strong> \u2013 Shape spaces that confuse, tempt, or just mildly inconvenience. March Rogues through sticky movie theaters, pelt them with tomatoes, and use the nearby 5G antennas to amplify the damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gadgets</strong> \u2013 Use items like snacks, springboards, shovels, and shuffles to manipulate Rogues, rearrange your labyrinth, and straighten up your hand. An effective manager uses every confiscated item in their toolkit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Personas</strong> \u2013 Choose your management style: Big Tech Manager, Feudal Lord, or Casino Boss. Each character deploys unique gadgets and a different strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unusual Characters</strong> \u2013 Encounter unruly Rogues like endless Russian Nesting Dolls, hot-headed Headless Hooligans, and the corner-challenged Monoceros. Show some grit and you might even get to enjoy Showtime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay Value</strong> \u2013 Expand and refine your tile deck each run, experimenting with new combinations and effects with each self-contained run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Workspace</strong> \u2013 Make things work for you, with a slew of quality of life and accessibility features: remappable controls, color-blind friendly options, visual overlays, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music to Match</strong> - A brand new original soundtrack by indie music star <strong>Joanna Wang</strong>, with <strong>Andrew Page</strong>, and <strong>Baron Jan</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563500?t=1768603537","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/689b64d1a60109da56e2a91241a948a22a4c6608/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768603537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/56018b25aa697ba11d43fe111e832ffbada0c22f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768603537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/56018b25aa697ba11d43fe111e832ffbada0c22f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768603537","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on your new role as big tech manager, feudal lord, or casino pit boss in Rogue Maze, a <strong>tile-based maze defense</strong> game that combines tower defense and deckbuilding elements with a darkly playful take on modern society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been brought in to manage the <strong>Rogues</strong>, an odd assortment of characters who just want to go home. These dastardly denizens try to cross each level along the shortest route. Redirect them through <i>labyrinths of your own design</i> and ensure they become too exhausted to leave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/6a0d21627a093e6fcac35e6a0ba4133b.poster.avif?t=1768603537\" aria-label=\"A sped-up build sequence from in-game. A translucent blue line is drawn to help with planning before tiles are placed on the board to create the labyrinth. After the first tiles are laid, waves of Rogues (NPCs) try to travel through. The board appears as a rectangular grassy island with lilac trees and castle walls at its edges.\" width=1170 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/6a0d21627a093e6fcac35e6a0ba4133b.webm?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/6a0d21627a093e6fcac35e6a0ba4133b.mp4?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build with Intention</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a basic tile deck, you'll have the path segments needed to turn open floor plans into <i>optimally inefficient layouts</i>\u2014but you're not one to settle for the bare minimum, are you? Draw from a variety of <strong>Special Tiles</strong> to gain maze-work benefits like status effects and damage multipliers. With some strategic positioning, obstacles like stinky bathrooms, security lasers, or slip-and-slides (some assembly required) can dramatically boost that return on investment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/de0e19734b56eb1b748e8e501c94e2d2.poster.avif?t=1768603537\" aria-label=\"ALT TEXT: SNAKE LOOP A sped-up sequence of various Rogues traveling through a giant green snake wearing a monocle. Rogues can be seen entering the snake\u2019s mouth and traversing through its exposed rib cage. One small Rogue makes its escape from the tail end of the snake.\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/de0e19734b56eb1b748e8e501c94e2d2.webm?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/de0e19734b56eb1b748e8e501c94e2d2.mp4?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exhaust and Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Troubled by a particularly pesky Rogue? <strong>Gadgets</strong> are conveniently located on each level to handle their insubordination. Deploy a giant springboard or offer free food to interrupt unwelcome activities and re-establish order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficiently address disruptive, rebellious behavior, and you'll be rewarded with a shiny new job title and increased visibility with Senior Leadership. Fail to meet your performance targets, however, and you'll be shown the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/1a9dacb5c564c3a5087c65dfbe87cb8a.poster.avif?t=1768603537\" aria-label=\"ALT TEXT: FIGHT LOOP A sped-up sequence of the Wrestling Tile in action. Several Rogues\u20142 neckless wrestlers and 2 anthropomorphic filing cabinets\u2014get into position in a square tile. The tile then rises from the floor as ropes and spotlights appear. A cartoonish cloud obscures a brief fight, after which the ring sinks back to floor level and one combatant walks away triumphant, with a wrestling belt held high.\" width=1170 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/1a9dacb5c564c3a5087c65dfbe87cb8a.webm?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/extras/1a9dacb5c564c3a5087c65dfbe87cb8a.mp4?t=1768603537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze-as-a-Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Build labyrinths from tiles that act as both pathways and towers, amplifying the classic <i>mazing</i> thrill of tower defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hostile Architecture</strong> \u2013 Shape spaces that confuse, tempt, or just mildly inconvenience. March Rogues through sticky movie theaters, pelt them with tomatoes, and use the nearby 5G antennas to amplify the damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gadgets</strong> \u2013 Use items like snacks, springboards, shovels, and shuffles to manipulate Rogues, rearrange your labyrinth, and straighten up your hand. An effective manager uses every confiscated item in their toolkit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Personas</strong> \u2013 Choose your management style: Big Tech Manager, Feudal Lord, or Casino Boss. Each character deploys unique gadgets and a different strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unusual Characters</strong> \u2013 Encounter unruly Rogues like endless Russian Nesting Dolls, hot-headed Headless Hooligans, and the corner-challenged Monoceros. Show some grit and you might even get to enjoy Showtime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay Value</strong> \u2013 Expand and refine your tile deck each run, experimenting with new combinations and effects with each self-contained run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Workspace</strong> \u2013 Make things work for you, with a slew of quality of life and accessibility features: remappable controls, color-blind friendly options, visual overlays, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music to Match</strong> - A brand new original soundtrack by indie music star <strong>Joanna Wang</strong>, with <strong>Andrew Page</strong>, and <strong>Baron Jan</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bionic Wombat Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/e8ab4074f739ac20e9f27fca7fb550bfc97dbb0d/header.jpg?t=1768603537","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Rogue Maze","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Bionic Wombat Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/e9533dc9aade957d7fae2046bce79ead8b4ed5de/ss_e9533dc9aade957d7fae2046bce79ead8b4ed5de.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/e9533dc9aade957d7fae2046bce79ead8b4ed5de/ss_e9533dc9aade957d7fae2046bce79ead8b4ed5de.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/f02d94108c8fb64e7e891c0ab045d7de3f76ac8d/ss_f02d94108c8fb64e7e891c0ab045d7de3f76ac8d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/f02d94108c8fb64e7e891c0ab045d7de3f76ac8d/ss_f02d94108c8fb64e7e891c0ab045d7de3f76ac8d.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/07e60e08040d82d8b66df8d3611f7f95404bf256/ss_07e60e08040d82d8b66df8d3611f7f95404bf256.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/07e60e08040d82d8b66df8d3611f7f95404bf256/ss_07e60e08040d82d8b66df8d3611f7f95404bf256.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/034816e4fd740690f9004d3f0e9ed7b9ada81111/ss_034816e4fd740690f9004d3f0e9ed7b9ada81111.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/034816e4fd740690f9004d3f0e9ed7b9ada81111/ss_034816e4fd740690f9004d3f0e9ed7b9ada81111.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/5b31cfb29fb0cbf8453f45fba268c08240fe12d0/ss_5b31cfb29fb0cbf8453f45fba268c08240fe12d0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/5b31cfb29fb0cbf8453f45fba268c08240fe12d0/ss_5b31cfb29fb0cbf8453f45fba268c08240fe12d0.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/ac3c5bfca1cd4222292c280776c6a5f0b9c8721a/ss_ac3c5bfca1cd4222292c280776c6a5f0b9c8721a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/ac3c5bfca1cd4222292c280776c6a5f0b9c8721a/ss_ac3c5bfca1cd4222292c280776c6a5f0b9c8721a.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/1fa9bb635e3112cb4f15fb83bb69f8556c2df6db/ss_1fa9bb635e3112cb4f15fb83bb69f8556c2df6db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/1fa9bb635e3112cb4f15fb83bb69f8556c2df6db/ss_1fa9bb635e3112cb4f15fb83bb69f8556c2df6db.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/9d805ffaaef59cdde3fb6769da1e8486835603c6/ss_9d805ffaaef59cdde3fb6769da1e8486835603c6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/9d805ffaaef59cdde3fb6769da1e8486835603c6/ss_9d805ffaaef59cdde3fb6769da1e8486835603c6.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/54cb5acd7e84d44f771c9cb07c8a4c242c5a0a3f/ss_54cb5acd7e84d44f771c9cb07c8a4c242c5a0a3f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/54cb5acd7e84d44f771c9cb07c8a4c242c5a0a3f/ss_54cb5acd7e84d44f771c9cb07c8a4c242c5a0a3f.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/66874cef8645f84ae5acd29b93eab0b52c67e141/ss_66874cef8645f84ae5acd29b93eab0b52c67e141.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/66874cef8645f84ae5acd29b93eab0b52c67e141/ss_66874cef8645f84ae5acd29b93eab0b52c67e141.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/32bdc5aad1110d7271266614eaf6ffc6578adbb6/ss_32bdc5aad1110d7271266614eaf6ffc6578adbb6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/32bdc5aad1110d7271266614eaf6ffc6578adbb6/ss_32bdc5aad1110d7271266614eaf6ffc6578adbb6.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/d40ce857ee1960f10f40f5821c04e0f9c4ce09b9/ss_d40ce857ee1960f10f40f5821c04e0f9c4ce09b9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768603537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563500/d40ce857ee1960f10f40f5821c04e0f9c4ce09b9/ss_d40ce857ee1960f10f40f5821c04e0f9c4ce09b9.600x338.jpg?t=1768603537"}],"short_description":"Design deviously winding pathways that maximize for fun and profit in this quirky maze-defense roguelike. Plan your maze, create hellish structures with special tiles, add a few distractions, then watch as everyone collapses from exhaustion. But watch out! Your success may be your demise.","steam_appid":3563500,"support_info":{"email":"support@bionicwombatgames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://rogue-maze.com/"}